// Deliberately empty of weapons.
//
// WP_LoadWeaponParms fills every weapon's damage from the compiled-in
// defaultDamage tables before it parses anything, and WP_ParseParms only looks
// for "{" blocks - so a file with none in it leaves those defaults standing.
// What the engine actually needs from this path is that the file exist at all:
// without it G_InitGame stops at Com_Error(ERR_FATAL).
//
// docs/Backlog.md section 10: an engine that cannot start without a data file
// from the retail game, in order to use values it already has compiled in,
// should be carrying that file itself.
